  'reporting':{title:'Reports & insights',lead:'Read the performance.<br>Understand the progress.',description:'See recorded orders and commission without mixing accounts, businesses or currencies.',cards:[['chart','A period you can inspect','Choose a UTC date range and filter a specific partnership. Later refunds update the recorded order’s current state.'],['users','The view that belongs to you','Brands see their program’s performance; affiliates see their own participating partnerships.'],['download','Exports with a purpose','Download scoped CSV reports with exact minor-unit amounts, without bank destinations or provider secrets.']],steps:[['Choose your period','Use a preset or a custom report range.'],['Explore the right scope','Inspect partnership and currency totals, then daily recorded order counts.'],['Keep balances in context','Current commission balances are all-time figures and are labelled separately from the selected performance period.']]},
